    "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight-looking pleated fabric shown in the supplied image; exact fiber content is not supplied.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A coordinated mom-and-daughter maxi-dress look for vacations, outdoor celebrations, and family photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Color:</strong> Rosewater Ombre fades from soft pink to white.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Slim shoulder straps, a softly gathered neckline, allover pleats, and a flowing A-line maxi silhouette.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Follow the sewn-in garment label; an exact care method is not supplied.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 2 Years through Child 9-10 Years and Mother S through Mother 2XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\" class=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n<th>Skirt Length (cm)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short or - (cm)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>7.5-11 kg</td>\n<td>80-90 cm</td>\n<td>50 cm</td>\n<td>54 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>54 cm</td>\n<td>50 cm</td>\n<td>54 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>11-15 kg</td>\n<td>90-100 cm</td>\n<td>54 cm</td>\n<td>59 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>58 cm</td>\n<td>54 cm</td>\n<td>59 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>15-19 kg</td>\n<td>100-110 cm</td>\n<td>58 cm</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n<td>58 cm</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>19-22.5 kg</td>\n<td>110-120 cm</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n<td>62 cm</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>22.5-27.5 kg</td>\n<td>120-130 cm</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n<td>66 cm</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27.5-32.5 kg</td>\n<td>130-140 cm</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n<td>74 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>74 cm</td>\n<td>70 cm</td>\n<td>74 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32.5-40 kg</td>\n<td>140-150 cm</td>\n<td>74 cm</td>\n<td>78 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>78 cm</td>\n<td>74 cm</td>\n<td>78 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>40-50 kg</td>\n<td>155-160 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>97 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>88 cm</td>\n<td>97 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>50-57.5 kg</td>\n<td>155-160 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>102 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm</td>\n<td>102 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>57.5-65 kg</td>\n<td>155-165 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>107 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>96 cm</td>\n<td>107 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>65-72.5 kg</td>\n<td>165-170 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>112 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100 cm</td>\n<td>112 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>72.5-80 kg</td>\n<td>170-175 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>117 cm</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>104 cm</td>\n<td>117 cm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Rosewater Ombre gives mom-and-daughter dressing a soft, flowing finish with the same pink-to-white fade and fine pleated texture across both dress choices. Select each child or mother size separately to build the matching combination you need.</p>\n\n<p>Each dress is sold separately. The cardigan, bags, shoes, and other styling accessories shown in the image are not included. Every available variant maps to one row in the attached size chart.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom + daughter match:</strong> Coordinated child and mother dresses in one ombre colorway.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pink-to-white fade:</strong> A soft gradient keeps the matching look light and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pleated maxi shape:</strong> Fine vertical pleats and a flowing A-line silhouette are visible on both dresses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed sizing:</strong> Seven child rows and five mother rows are transcribed from the supplied chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Separate selections:</strong> Add the child and mother sizes you want; this is not a bundled set.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need for a softly coordinated Rosewater Ombre moment.</p>",
